https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://plus.google.com/%2BAdaptativaBr/posts&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422753087000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2T81zoN-BBsKZ9BD6BMflK\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/mhA_P_8E0pmuRnT1agE9wcSBWAE2DnO4LSA8T4HnXIKGoAhINpDb8uD8URx6EX9tPaMBl5EkXbAFsTBV-0VBqwx6Rdlg8Jrs69CkwXCbKS1W=s0-d-e1-ft#https://s3.amazonaws.com/htmlsig-assets/rounded/googleplus.png\" alt=\"Google Plus\" style=\"margin-bottom:5px;border:none;display:inline\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/Adaptativa\" style=\"text-decoration:none;display:inline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/user/Adaptativa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422753087000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15Shb1PSsjd7B6BndPcHi7\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/jyERAArzGOrJ5J6j2KqILf4cpSNChzTjlVyzQUkGsROeiabdFzcBrkCrC6IUxdNY1SZD45idUDPV8GflWCEfYff43HQx43GI2g19CZxt=s0-d-e1-ft#https://s3.amazonaws.com/htmlsig-assets/rounded/youtube.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" style=\"margin-bottom:5px;border:none;display:inline\"></a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
